  "issue_title": "feat(submission): fitness history, ledger volume, and head diversity gates (8-10)",
  "issue_body": "## Summary\n\n- Adds `trinity.submission.provenance_audit` with three offline pre-eval gates:\n  - **fitness_history_sequence** \u2014 consecutive generation indices, no duplicates, mean \u2264 max, monotonic running best\n  - **ledger_call_volume** \u2014 when `TRINITY_COST_LEDGER` is set: verified chain, minimum token volume vs `generations \u00d7 popsize`, \u22652 pool models seen\n  - **head_routing_diversity** \u2014 agent logit rows must not collapse (pairwise cosine \u2264 0.999 after mean-centering)\n- Wires gates into `OFFLINE_GATES`, `scripts/pr_eval.py`, `scripts/preflight_submission.py`, and `SUBMITTING.md` (10 gates total)\n- Includes `tests/test_submission_provenance_audit.py` (22 offline tests) and CI fixes for stale LCB `testtype` + cached `routing_transcript` tests\n\nCloses #208\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pytest tests/test_submission_provenance_audit.py tests/test_submission_preflight.py tests/test_submission_schema.py`\n- [x] `pytest tests/test_loaders_hf_parsers.py tests/test_svf_submission.py` (CI stale-test fixes)\n- [x] `ruff check src/trinity/submission/provenance_audit.py tests/test_submission_provenance_audit.py`",
